<title>USA: In Home Health Inc Q1 Dec 31 loss widens.</title>
<headline>In Home Health Inc Q1 Dec 31 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>MINNETONKA, Minn. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p>Shr loss</p>
<p>applicable to</p>
<p> common stock	    $ 0.04     loss	 $0.02</p>
<p>Net loss</p>
<p>applicable to</p>
<p> common stock		 660     loss	   404</p>
<p> Revs			31,585		   32,468</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  16,416		   16,473</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 loss applicable to common stock is primarily a result of the preferred stock dividend payable to Manor Healthcare Corp for its $20 million investment in In Home Health in October 1995. Excluding the dividend, the company had net income of $14,000 vs $98,000.</p>
